{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_title", "source_sha256": "4f793bf904ff1f0d4182ecaa5d3a3066ed41bfaceabc838c7fac006376ddd008", "ja": "明日のみんなへ", "zh": "致明日的大家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_synopsis", "source_sha256": "f815b4448a10a5a61979cecf8c951ef7ba9d428d54722c7376e5373fc59b58bb", "ja": "記念公演の初日を終え、余韻に浸るアイドル\n達。上機嫌で乾杯を促す莉緒だったが、公演\nはまだ続くため気は抜けない。ひとまずジュ\nースで乾杯し、アイドル達は気持ちを高めて\nいくのだった。", "zh": "纪念公演首日落幕，偶像们沉浸在余韵之中。莉緒兴致高昂地提议举杯庆祝，但公演尚未结束，不能掉以轻心。众人先以果汁干杯，互相鼓舞，振奋心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1000_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "bf2be5285129371640387c4f45fd3108bb729005812aa43a982eb99b5f787b07", "ja": "ワアアァァァァァーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7835bc0a77b41da4055209d95a827ca835af251e235746c798d8a75b670343c8", "ja": "（記念公演の初日、会場は空気を震わせるほどの\n大歓声に包まれた……やったぞ、最高のスタートだ！）", "zh": "（纪念公演首日，会场被震撼空气般的欢呼声包围了……干得漂亮，这是最棒的开场！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "c38801743c46f03923c32912555c5ac3afe8f2cdf712f51507e4ddde010b51f5", "ja": "いろんなミステイク～♪　越えて明日へ行く～♪\n握ったマイク～♪　チャンスメイク～♪", "zh": "跨越种种失误～♪　向着明天前进～♪\n紧握手中的麦克风～♪　创造机会～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "120ffe030d70c468d1d33a60d2ef3602b824181e1be64096eee006d903f6eb91", "ja": "はれっ？　瑞希さん、どうかしたんですか？\nなんだか難しい顔をしてますけど……？", "zh": "咦？瑞希，你怎么了？\n总觉得你一脸严肃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "3a130ea3fdd6014afdd7fe6bd4310bd8792fac3a6f46de44f5d34de8c0b1e7f9", "ja": "いえ、特に難しくはありません。簡単です。\nライブの余韻に浸っていただけで……じーん。", "zh": "不，没什么难的。很简单。只是在回味演唱会的余韵……心里一阵阵感动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "e95480c8437c2721e7986d651f77cce93a0c20c3e785966ffc0531945444b7f2", "ja": "あーっ、わかります！　公演の後って、お客さんの\n声が耳の奥で鳴り止まないんですよね♪　ららら～♪", "zh": "啊——我懂！演出结束后，观众的声音会一直在耳朵深处回响，停不下来呢♪ 啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "89121fce0899c07bef31c671654e10e14ce65dba18b716c5cab80e2664ff621e", "ja": "ふたりとも、気持ちはわかるけど、とりあえず\n水分補給ね。それから、体を冷やさないように。", "zh": "你们两个，我能理解你们的心情，不过先补充水分吧。然后，别让身体着凉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3a3d1fa15d506ff3cebb1e16cd02c19d968b256928456ca95148c842d853b0c9", "ja": "公演はまだ続くんだから、\n体調は万全にしておかないとダメだからね。", "zh": "演出还要继续，所以一定要保持最佳状态才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ee747447747e6f86d0f602ab1855fde3997eeea7e56b8ace5922517f8177516", "ja": "みんなーっ！　お疲れさまー！\n飲み物持った？　とりあえず乾杯しましょ！", "zh": "大家——！辛苦啦——！\n饮料都拿好了吗？总之先干杯吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "093d1729034a090571680bfbf075ea38fc3b631b64a1bc8e3f7f23328def4779", "ja": "り、莉緒さん、まさかそれお酒じゃ……？", "zh": "莉、莉绪姐，难道那是酒……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "e833f483323832747f69bba3d000fc53f057f00ef1d4152d0f0dc46fe05b86a9", "ja": "ウフフ♪　ジュースだから大丈夫よ！\n風花ちゃんったら、今日はみんなのお母さんみたいね。", "zh": "呵呵♪是果汁，所以没关系哦！\n风花真是的，今天简直像大家的妈妈一样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a84a244ef6dfebab652e9d1eaa1ff4ba0ce2620b43045d022d63b2e5fd29968a", "ja": "ええっ！？　口うるさかったですか……？\n私、何も水を差したかったわけじゃなくて……！", "zh": "诶！？我是不是太啰嗦了……？\n我也不是想泼冷水……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "9d194c216bb9ee3e02dc31003f94de60fb7021626c195f9195ce085c5b8cf2a7", "ja": "わかってるわ！　心配してくれたのよね。\n優しいし、頼もしいって言いたかったの！", "zh": "我知道的！你也是在担心我，对吧。\n我想说的是，你既温柔又可靠！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b391998cf10314c412a02e4cff341b6b348efc98d4cab6e1b4ecd69b889ee0c2", "ja": "おーいみんな、お疲れ！　すごくいい公演だったぞ。", "zh": "喂——大家，辛苦了！这场演出非常精彩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a167ef4ed709ddde92701474483b6a95b19be79cfe17171ea3a2ba53ac5bab9b", "ja": "今回はみんなに任せるところも多かったから、\n色々大変だったと思うけど……。", "zh": "这次有很多地方都交给大家来完成，我想一定挺辛苦的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1016_p", "source_sha256": "684b8b74ab55073a928b40af988db1ad357cbe11097d35e064a34923a292b838", "ja": "いちファンとして、新鮮な気持ちで見られたよ。\nありがとう、みんな。", "zh": "作为一名粉丝，我能以新鲜的心情观看这一切。\n谢谢大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "c7679ca5cdf73bd8155c9e779aceeee040ed408aa3a535f7e6e74604d4580678", "ja": "それなら、頑張って準備した甲斐がありました。\n虜にしてしまったぞ、瑞希……ずっきゅん。", "zh": "那样的话，我努力准备就有意义了。\n把你迷住了哦，瑞希……砰砰心动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "f8abbc91e0801463c05c0e5bb0926e134f531c22c136f0e33900583f5d716a34", "ja": "{$P$}さんの褒め言葉で、\n可奈はすくすく育ちま～す♪　えへっ。", "zh": "有了{$P$}先生的夸奖，\n可奈就会茁壮成长～♪ 嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1019_p", "source_sha256": "737d040100010a28e9512a37a00203fcededda397bfc52cca71713353348794d", "ja": "でも、公演はまだ続くからな！　今までのファンにも、\nこれから出会う未来のファンにも……", "zh": "不过，公演还要继续呢！无论是一直以来的粉丝，还是今后将要遇见的未来的粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f3958d8e5c188f4a76911c6f0a0d66e247c97b342abf687fd77289dfde944b3f", "ja": "ひとりでも多くの人に、みんなの歌声を\n届けてあげて欲しい。よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "希望你们把大家的歌声传达给更多的人。拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_13_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_13_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
